    "message": "Build the information policy's view without the unused audit hash\n\n_sample_information_contacts built its WorldView with the default audit\nhash, which serializes and hashes every person and facility at every tick.\nInformation policies read only the view's people and minute; the behavior\ndecisions, which record the hash, still build their view with it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
